Output demos/01-complete-workflow.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 20
Set Framerate 15
Set Width 1800
Set Height 1000
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 40
Set TypingSpeed 150ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.5

Hide
Type "source demos/.recording_venv/bin/activate"
Enter
Type "export PS1='$ '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "python demo_run/complete_workflow.py"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 20s

Sleep 4s
